sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant S as scan screen / auto-scan
  participant G as Gallery + on-device QR reader
  participant F as Edge Function parse-slip
  participant AI as Gemini (2 reads)
  participant D as domain/slip.ts
  participant DB as Supabase
  U->>S: Open app / tap Scan slips
  S->>G: find recent images, newest first
  G-->>S: images with a slip QR (bank code, reference)
  S->>F: send slip images only (+ JWT)
  F->>AI: 2 models read in parallel
  AI-->>F: amount, date, time, payee + confidence
  F-->>S: cleaned result
  S->>D: normalizeReading + 3-layer duplicate check
  alt every field ≥ 0.80 and not a duplicate
    D->>DB: insert (confirmed) → counted in balance
  else any field < 0.80 / empty
    D->>DB: insert (draft) → user reviews
  end
